## Legal text

### Article 25 – Reporting and review

By 17 July 2027, the Commission shall submit to the European Parliament and to the Council a report assessing the extent to which each Member State has taken the necessary measures to comply with [this Directive](/lagstiftning/cer).

The Commission shall periodically review the functioning of [this Directive](/lagstiftning/cer) and report to the European Parliament and to the Council. That report shall, in particular, assess the added value of [this Directive](/lagstiftning/cer), its impact on ensuring the resilience of critical entities and whether the Annex to [this Directive](/lagstiftning/cer) should be modified. The Commission shall submit the first such report by 17 June 2029. For the purpose of reporting under [this Article](#article-25-reporting-and-review), the Commission shall take into account relevant documents of the Critical Entities Resilience Group.

### Article 26 – Transposition

1\. By 17 October 2024, Member States shall adopt and publish the measures necessary to comply with [this Directive](/lagstiftning/cer). They shall immediately inform the Commission thereof.

They shall apply those measures from 18 October 2024.

2\. When Member States adopt the measures referred to in paragraph 1, they shall contain a reference to [this Directive](/lagstiftning/cer) or be accompanied by such reference on the occasion of their official publication. The methods of making such reference shall be laid down by Member States.

### Article 27 – Repeal of Directive 2008/114/EC

[Directive 2008/114/EC](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32008L0114) is repealed with effect from 18 October 2024.

References to the repealed Directive shall be construed as references to [this Directive](/lagstiftning/cer).

### Article 28 – Entry into force

[This Directive](/lagstiftning/cer) shall enter into force on the twentieth day following that of its publication in the Official Journal of the European Union.

### Article 29 – Addressees

[This Directive](/lagstiftning/cer) is addressed to the Member States.

#### Signature

Done at Strasbourg, 14 December 2022.

For the European Parliament

The President

R. METSOLA

For the Council

The President

M. BEK

