Categories of entities

1\. Energy

(a) Electricity

— Electricity undertakings as defined in Article [2](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-2-definitions), point (57), of [Directive (EU) 2019/944](/lagstiftning/elmarknadsdirektivet) of the European Parliament and of the Council (1), which carry out the function of ‘supply’ as defined in Article [2](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-2-definitions), point (12), of that Directive

— Distribution system operators as defined in Article [2](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-2-definitions), point (29), of [Directive (EU) 2019/944](/lagstiftning/elmarknadsdirektivet)

— Transmission system operators as defined in Article [2](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-2-definitions), point (35), of [Directive (EU) 2019/944](/lagstiftning/elmarknadsdirektivet)

— Producers as defined in Article [2](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-2-definitions), point (38), of [Directive (EU) 2019/944](/lagstiftning/elmarknadsdirektivet)

— Nominated electricity market operators as defined in Article [2](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-2-definitions), point (8), of [Regulation (EU) 2019/943](/lagstiftning/elmarknadsforordningen) of the European Parliament and of the Council (2)

— Market participants as defined in Article [2](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-2-definitions), point (25), of [Regulation (EU) 2019/943](/lagstiftning/elmarknadsforordningen) providing aggregation, demand response or energy storage services as defined in Article [2](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-2-definitions), points (18), (20) and (59), of [Directive (EU) 2019/944](/lagstiftning/elmarknadsdirektivet)

