— Transmission system operators as defined in Article [2](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-2-definitions), point (4), of [Directive 2009/73/EC](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32009L0073)

