2\. Transport

(a) Air

— Air carriers as defined in Article [3](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-3-minimum-harmonisation), point (4), of [Regulation (EC) No 300/2008](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32008R0300) used for commercial purposes

