(b) Rail

— Infrastructure managers as defined in Article [3](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-3-minimum-harmonisation), point (2), of [Directive 2012/34/EU](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32012L0034) of the European Parliament and of the Council (9)

