(c) Water

— Inland, sea and coastal passenger and freight water transport companies, as defined for maritime transport in Annex I to [Regulation (EC) No 725/2004](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32004R0725), not including the individual vessels operated by those companies

