(d) Road

— Road authorities as defined in Article [2](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-2-definitions), point (12), of Commission Delegated [Regulation (EU) 2015/962](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32015R0962) (11) responsible for traffic management control, excluding public entities for whom traffic-management or the operation of intelligent transport systems is a non-essential part of their general activity

— Operators of Intelligent Transport Systems as defined in Article [4](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-2#article-4-strategy-on-the-resilience-of-critical-entities), point (1), of [Directive 2010/40/EU](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32010L0040) of the European Parliament and of the Council (12)

(e) public transport

— Public service operators as defined in Article [2](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-2-definitions), point (d), of [Regulation (EC) No 1370/2007](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32007R1370) of the European Parliament and of the Council (13)

3\. Banking

