4\. Financial market infrastructure

— Operators of trading venues as defined in Article [4](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-2#article-4-strategy-on-the-resilience-of-critical-entities), point (24), of [Directive 2014/65/EU](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32014L0065)

— Central counterparties (CCPs) as defined in Article [2](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-2-definitions), point (1), of [Regulation (EU) No 648/2012](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32012R0648)

5\. Health

— Healthcare providers as defined in Article [3](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-3-minimum-harmonisation), point (g), of [Directive 2011/24/EU](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32011L0024) of the European Parliament and of the Council (14)

— EU reference laboratories as referred to in Article [15](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32022R2371) of [Regulation (EU) 2022/2371](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32022R2371) of the European Parliament and of the Council (15)

— Entities carrying out research and development activities of medicinal products as defined in Article [1](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-1-subject-matter-and-scope), point (2), of [Directive 2001/83/EC](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32001L0083) of the European Parliament and of the Council (16)

— Entities manufacturing basic pharmaceutical products and pharmaceutical preparations as referred to in Section C division 21 of NACE Rev. 2

— Entities manufacturing medical devices considered as critical during a public health emergency (‘public health emergency critical devices list’) within the meaning of Article [22](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32022R0123) of [Regulation (EU) 2022/123](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32022R0123) of the European Parliament and of the Council (17)

— Entities holding a distribution authorisation as referred to in Article [79](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32001L0083) of [Directive 2001/83/EC](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32001L0083)

6\. Drinking water

— Suppliers and distributors of water intended for human consumption as defined in Article [2](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-2-definitions), point (1)(a), of [Directive (EU) 2020/2184](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32020L2184) of the European Parliament and of the Council (18), excluding distributors for which distribution of water for human consumption is a non-essential part of their general activity of distributing other commodities and goods

7\. Waste water

— Undertakings collecting, disposing of or treating urban waste water, domestic waste water or industrial waste water as defined in Article [2](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-2-definitions), points (1), (2) and (3), of Council Directive 91/271/EEC (19), excluding undertakings for which collecting, disposing of or treating urban waste water, domestic waste water or industrial waste water is a non-essential part of their general activity

8\. Digital infrastructure

— Providers of internet exchange points as defined in Article [6](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-2#article-6-identification-of-critical-entities), point (18), of [Directive (EU) 2022/2555](/lagstiftning/nis2)

— DNS service providers as defined in Article [6](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-2#article-6-identification-of-critical-entities), point (20), of [Directive (EU) 2022/2555](/lagstiftning/nis2), excluding operators of root name servers

— top-level-domain name registries as defined in Article [6](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-2#article-6-identification-of-critical-entities), point (21), of [Directive (EU) 2022/2555](/lagstiftning/nis2)

— Providers of cloud computing services as defined in Article [6](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-2#article-6-identification-of-critical-entities), point (30), of [Directive (EU) 2022/2555](/lagstiftning/nis2)

— Providers of data centre services as defined in Article [6](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-2#article-6-identification-of-critical-entities), point (31), of [Directive (EU) 2022/2555](/lagstiftning/nis2)

— Providers of content delivery networks as defined in Article [6](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-2#article-6-identification-of-critical-entities), point (32), of [Directive (EU) 2022/2555](/lagstiftning/nis2)

— Trust service providers as defined in Article [3](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-3-minimum-harmonisation), point (19), of [Regulation (EU) No 910/2014](/lagstiftning/eidas) of the European Parliament and of the Council (20)

— Providers of public electronic communications networks as defined in Article [2](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-2-definitions), point (8), of [Directive (EU) 2018/1972](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32018L1972) of the European Parliament and of the Council (21)

— Providers of electronic communications services as defined in Article [2](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-2-definitions), point (4), of [Directive (EU) 2018/1972](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32018L1972) insofar as their services are publicly available

9\. Public administration

— Public administration entities of central governments as defined by Member States in accordance with national law

10\. Space

— Operators of ground-based infrastructure, owned, managed and operated by Member States or by private parties, that support the provision of space-based services, excluding providers of public electronic communications networks as defined in Article [2](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-2-definitions), point (8), of [Directive (EU) 2018/1972](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32018L1972)

11\. Production, processing and distribution of food

— Food businesses as defined in Article [3](/lagstiftning/cer/kap-1#article-3-minimum-harmonisation), point (2), of [Regulation (EC) No 178/2002](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32002R0178) of the European Parliament and of the Council (22) which are engaged exclusively in logistics and wholesale distribution and large scale industrial production and processing

(1) [Directive (EU) 2019/944](/lagstiftning/elmarknadsdirektivet) of the European Parliament and of the Council of 5 June 2019 on common rules for the internal market for electricity and amending [Directive 2012/27/EU](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32012L0027) (OJ L 158, 14.6.2019, p. 125).

(2) [Regulation (EU) 2019/943](/lagstiftning/elmarknadsforordningen) of the European Parliament and of the Council of 5 June 2019 on the internal market for electricity (OJ L 158, 14.6.2019, p. 54).

(3) [Directive (EU) 2018/2001](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32018L2001) of the European Parliament and of the Council of 11 December 2018 on the promotion of the use of energy from renewable sources (OJ L 328, 21.12.2018, p. 82).

(4) Council [Directive 2009/119/EC](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32009L0119) of 14 September 2009 imposing an obligation on Member States to maintain minimum stocks of crude oil and/or petroleum products (OJ L 265, 9.10.2009, p. 9).

